# Feature artifacts

- One folder per request: `features/{kebab-slug}/`. Reuse it; do not fork a second spec for the same ask.
- **route.md** is required before specialists (`change_class` micro | minor | feature).
- Feature class: `plan.md`, `spec-order.md`, `test-plan.md`, child folders `features/{slug}/{child}/specification.md`, telemetry/dev HANDOFFs per child, parent `qa-test-cases.md`, `qa-signoff.md`, `RETRO.md`.
- Micro/minor: `patch.md` plus skipped-step stubs per change-routing; still `deploy-result.env` and `RETRO.md` after devops. Flat folder (no PM, no children).
- Fill every spec section (`N/A — reason` if needed). Label assumptions. Every Must FR needs an AC.
- HANDOFF `status` is `SUCCESS` | `BLOCKED` | `ASSUMPTIONS_USED` | `FAILED` as defined by the agent brief. Never `SUCCESS` with blocking open questions.
- Critic verdicts: `approve` | `approve-with-nits` | `changes-required`. Findings cite FR/AC/section or file path.
- Do not put product source under `features/`. Do not treat `assets/example-specification.md` as a live feature spec.
